      "caption": "Hormone Happy Kitchen Ep 2 - Pineapple Ginger Gut Healing Gummies 🍍✨\n\nIngredients\n- 1½ cups pineapple juice (simmered 5 minutes, then cooled)\n- ¼ cup ginger juice\n- 1–2 tbsp raw honey\n- Pinch of sea salt\n- 2 tbsp grass-fed gelatin (3 if you want a firmer gummy)\n\nInstructions\n1. Simmer pineapple juice for 5 minutes to break down the bromelain, then let it cool slightly.\n2. In a saucepan, combine pineapple juice, ginger juice, honey, and sea salt.\n3. Sprinkle gelatin evenly over the top and let it bloom for 5 minutes.\n4. Place on low heat and stir gently until fully dissolved and smooth.\n5. Pour into a glass dish or silicone molds.\n6. Refrigerate for a few hours or overnight, until fully set.\n7. Cut into cubes if needed and enjoy.\n\n#healthyrecipes #hormonehealth #womenswellness #easyrecipe",
